            <ArticleTitle>Dynamics of the pneumonic plague epidemic in Madagascar, August to October 2017.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2807/1560-7917.ES.2017.22.46.17-00710</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Transmission potential and severity of pneumonic plague in Madagascar were assessed. Accounting for reporting delay, the reproduction number was estimated at 1.73. The case fatality risk was estimated as 5.5%. Expected numbers of exported cases from Madagascar were estimated across the world and all estimates were below 1 person from August to October, 2017.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
